REMARK   3                                                                      
REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : THE FINAL MODEL INCLUDES 24 CHAINS               
REMARK   3  REPRESENTING 12 PROTEIN A POLYPEPTIDES. CHAINS A-L REPRESENT THE    
REMARK   3  N-TERMINAL FLOOR SEGMENT BUILT INTO THE HIGH-RESOLUTION EM          
REMARK   3  DENSITY. CHAINS M-X REPRESENT A MAINCHAIN TRACE OF THE              
REMARK   3  POLYMERASE SEGMENT RIGID BODY FIT INTO THE MAP AND ARE INCLUDED     
REMARK   3  TO GIVE A MORE COMPLETE PICTURE OF THE MOLECULE. THE POLYMERASE     
REMARK   3  MAINCHAIN TRACE WAS REFINED FROM AN ALPHAFOLD PREDICTION INTO A     
REMARK   3  MAP OBTAINED BY SYMMETRY EXPANSION WITH SUBTRACTION. THE            
REMARK   3  POLYMERASE MAP IS UPLOADED AS A SEPARATE ENTRY. THE TWO SEGMENTS    
REMARK   3  HAVE SEPARATE CHAIN IDS AS IT IS UNCLEAR FROM THE DENSITY WHICH     
REMARK   3  POLYMERASE CONNECTS TO WHICH FLOOR SEGMENT.                         
